{"duration_api_ms":6859,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d731b792-26da-4710-86a5-645732999769","total_cost_usd":0.0009341999999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":733,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1094,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":721},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":733,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1094,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":733,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":733},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1276,"outputTokens":1320,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":733,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0009341999999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":923,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":733,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Mixed umbrella:** The ETF label does not attach to the umbrella ICAV or plc. Each sub-fund is a separate investment fund with its own LEI and prospectus description. Only sub-funds that are exchange-traded and described as ETFs should carry the label. Other sub-funds in the same umbrella are not ETFs, even though they share the legal wrapper.\n\n**Sub-fund versus listed class:** The sub-fund is identified by its own LEI and name. Each share class has its own ISIN. Exchange listings add tickers (for example, a Euronext or LSE line) that identify a specific listed class in a specific currency or venue.\n\n**Sub-fund with listed and unlisted classes:** The ETF identifier applies to the listed class, not to the whole sub-fund. Unlisted classes in the same sub-fund keep their own ISINs and are not exchange-traded. They should not be labelled ETFs.\n\n**Caveat:** \"UCITS ETF\" is a market term, not a separate UCITS legal category. Check the Central Bank of Ireland register and each fund's prospectus and KIID before relying on any label.","ttft_ms":3706,"type":"result","duration_ms":5588,"uuid":"a70d112d-c2d8-41a2-94dd-8c2ea0ee6124","ttft_stream_ms":439,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":439,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
